# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# jobs-ops only — NOT admissions
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# admissions-v2 task 12.4 (R11.9: "Any AI retained for another product SHALL be
# isolated outside the admissions boundary") moved this line out of the general
# list and into its own section, because `openai` is **not** a platform
# dependency: its single importer in the whole backend is
# `apps/jobs/ai_service.py`, which reads the `JOBS_OPS_AI_*` settings and serves
# the jobs-ops operator dashboard. Task 7.4 removed every admissions generative
# call; leaving the SDK in an unmarked list is how the next reader concludes
# admissions still has one, or deletes it and breaks a different product.
#
# The SDK is pointed at the Vercel AI Gateway, so the package name understates
# what it talks to; `docs/ai-data-flows.md` is the data map.
#
# `tests/unit/test_no_admissions_generative_ai_guard.py` fails if an admissions
# module imports it, or if its importer set grows beyond `apps/jobs/`.
openai>=1.40.0
